<title>FRANCE: Bouygues sells U.S. unit HDR for $55 mln.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sells U.S. unit HDR for $55 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French building group Bouygues said it has sold its U.S. HDR Inc architecture and engineering subsidiary to management for $55 million.</p>
<p>Bouygues bought the company in 1983, it said in a statement. It had 1995 sales of $182 million and made a pre-tax profit of $4 million.</p>
<p>The disposal is part of the French company's programme of sales of non-core assets.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
